      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your description captures a profound sense of melancholy and hopelessness, yet I must emphasize that thoughts of ending your life are not a solution to suffering, and there is immense relief in reaching out for help. Please consider reaching out to a mental health crisis line or trusted person immediately, as professional support can provide compassion and options that make the pain feel lighter. You are not alone in these feelings, and many people want to support you through this dark moment.",
